cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite this release."
title: "Projector-Resolved Seed Calculus III: Typed Edge Operators, Connection Defects, and Obstruction Packets"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Komorebi
    family-names: P.
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-03
abstract: >-
  A scope-explicit finite algebraic treatment of packet-supported edge
  operators, exact word-to-walk expansions, canonical coordinate transport,
  reversible connection defects and holonomy, gauge covariance,
  packet-resolved obstruction blocks, arbitrary-length heterogeneous paths
  over one common finite packet type, separately typed two- and three-step
  paths with changing packet types,
  operation-tree locality, and candidate-specific obstruction certificates,
  with a Lean 4 completion contract and deterministic generated figures.
